# Question 7 — Concurrency cancellation (Very Hard)

```yaml
concurrency:
  group: production
  cancel-in-progress: true
```

Two commits are pushed quickly:

```
Commit A starts deployment
Commit B starts deployment
```

What happens?

### Answer:

```
Commit A deployment cancelled
Commit B deployment continues
```

Because both belong to:

```
production
```

group.

