# Question 8 — Environment protection rule (GH-200 style)

```yaml
jobs:
 deploy:
   environment:
     name: production
```

Production environment requires:

```
Manual approval
```

What happens?

### Answer:

The job pauses before running steps.

Flow:

```
Job starts
   |
   ↓
Environment protection check
   |
   ↓
Waiting for approval
   |
   ↓
Steps execute
```

